  "description": "Two identical stages (two parties and their pigeonhole racks): in both, each party hands its card to the other (● Party A's, ◆ Party B's, at equal weight) at the same moments and the cards unfold their supplied attributes. The one changed fact is the supplied status: in A «Data complete»; in B «Capacity pending verification», where Party B's card carries a dashed pending ring — a pending state only, never a deficiency. A comparison table lists every event; the unfolding's row differs and a Δ guide outlines it. No winner, no rule on capacity, no legal effect.",
